---
title: "Countdown"
description: "A short video each weekday counting down to my last day at Rightmove on 18 December 2026."
date: 2026-10-13
---

<p>I'm leaving Rightmove on <strong>Friday 18 December 2026</strong>, so each weekday I'm recording a short video counting down to it: what I'm wrapping up, handing over and thinking about along the way. This page is the home for the series, in the order they were recorded.</p>

{% if countdown.latest %}
{% statCards %}
{% statCard "🎬", "Episodes", countdown.list | length %}
{% statCard "⏳", "Days to go", countdown.latest.daysToGo %}
{% statCard "📅", "Last day", "18 Dec" %}
{% endstatCards %}

<h2>Latest episode</h2>
{# Facade: a thumbnail link that js/countdown.js swaps for the real
   youtube-nocookie iframe on click. Without JS it is just a link to YouTube. #}
<div class="countdown-player countdown-player--featured">
  <a class="countdown-facade" href="{{ countdown.latest.url }}" data-embed="{{ countdown.latest.embedUrl }}" data-title="{{ countdown.latest.title }}">
    <img src="{{ countdown.latest.thumbnail }}" alt="" width="480" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    <span class="countdown-facade__play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
    <span class="countdown-facade__label">Play: {{ countdown.latest.title }}</span>
  </a>
</div>
<p><strong>{{ countdown.latest.title }}</strong></p>

<h2>All episodes</h2>
<ol class="countdown-list">
  {% for video in countdown.list %}
  <li class="countdown-list__item" id="days-{{ video.daysToGo }}">
    <h3 class="countdown-list__title">{{ video.title }}</h3>
    <p class="countdown-list__meta"><time datetime="{{ video.recorded }}">Recorded {{ video.recorded | readableIsoDate }}</time></p>
    <div class="countdown-player">
      <a class="countdown-facade" href="{{ video.url }}" data-embed="{{ video.embedUrl }}" data-title="{{ video.title }}">
        <img src="{{ video.thumbnail }}" alt="" width="480" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        <span class="countdown-facade__play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
        <span class="countdown-facade__label">Play: {{ video.title }}</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>

{# Top-level array on purpose: _11ty/json-ld.js adds an `image` property with
   site-relative URLs to the first JSON-LD object it finds, which would mangle
   these absolute thumbnail URLs on a single object (JSON.stringify ignores it on an array). #}
<script type="application/ld+json">
[
  {% for video in countdown.list %}
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "VideoObject",
    "name": {{ video.title | dump | safe }},
    "description": {{ ("Day " + video.daysToGo + " of my countdown to leaving Rightmove on 18 December 2026.") | dump | safe }},
    "thumbnailUrl": "{{ video.thumbnail }}",
    "uploadDate": "{{ video.recorded }}",
    "embedUrl": "{{ video.embedUrl }}",
    "contentUrl": "{{ video.url }}"
  }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
]
</script>

<script defer src="{{ '/js/countdown.js' | addHash }}"></script>
{% else %}
<p>The first episode is coming soon.</p>
{% endif %}
